{"3631710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Crimson Contract", "steam_appid": 3631710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The outbreak wasn't contained. It was covered up.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quarantine zones have fallen. The infected are spreading. And the people responsible for stopping the collapse have run out of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a contracted mercenary, you'll enter dangerous containment zones alone or with your squad to complete high-risk missions, recover valuable resources, and survive overwhelming waves of infected. Every contract is a gamble — push deeper for greater rewards, or extract before the quarantine zone becomes your grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic weapons. Build devastating loadouts. Unlock powerful upgrades. Call in support abilities. With every mission, you'll become stronger... but so will the threats waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the infected zones, the more you'll discover that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak was never just an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't here to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to uncover the truth behind <i><strong>The Crimson Contract</strong>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive Endless Infected Hordes</strong><br>Enter dangerous quarantine zones where every mission can become a desperate last stand. Fight through overwhelming waves of infected with unique behaviors, escalating threats, and impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Squad Up or Survive Alone</strong>  <br>Play solo or team up with friends in intense PvE missions. Coordinate your attacks, save your teammates, and create unforgettable moments as your plans inevitably fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Ultimate Zombie-Killing Arsenal</strong><br>Start with basic weapons and become a walking apocalypse. Upgrade your gear, unlock powerful abilities, and create devastating loadouts tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push Your Luck. Extract or Die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every contract is a gamble. Choose your equipment, manage your resources, and decide when to escape. Stay longer for bigger rewards... but risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Built for Co-op Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed for keyboard, mouse, and controller players, The Crimson Contract delivers seamless squad-based action whether you're fighting alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The outbreak wasn't contained. It was covered up.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quarantine zones have fallen. The infected are spreading. And the people responsible for stopping the collapse have run out of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's where you come in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a contracted mercenary, you'll enter dangerous containment zones alone or with your squad to complete high-risk missions, recover valuable resources, and survive overwhelming waves of infected. Every contract is a gamble — push deeper for greater rewards, or extract before the quarantine zone becomes your grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic weapons. Build devastating loadouts. Unlock powerful upgrades. Call in support abilities. With every mission, you'll become stronger... but so will the threats waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the infected zones, the more you'll discover that something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak was never just an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't here to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to uncover the truth behind <i><strong>The Crimson Contract</strong>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive Endless Infected Hordes</strong><br>Enter dangerous quarantine zones where every mission can become a desperate last stand. Fight through overwhelming waves of infected with unique behaviors, escalating threats, and impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/5c60fada89faacf4a317779e0887f4ea.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Squad Up or Survive Alone</strong>  <br>Play solo or team up with friends in intense PvE missions. Coordinate your attacks, save your teammates, and create unforgettable moments as your plans inevitably fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/15a4c2dbf8f60ec2d1b4722145c3ab1b.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Ultimate Zombie-Killing Arsenal</strong><br>Start with basic weapons and become a walking apocalypse. Upgrade your gear, unlock powerful abilities, and create devastating loadouts tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/bf036071ee2a7ece196b04b8eeaf82a0.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push Your Luck. Extract or Die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every contract is a gamble. Choose your equipment, manage your resources, and decide when to escape. Stay longer for bigger rewards... but risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/28c2f6cd832a32dd022a483c7f551f5c.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Built for Co-op Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed for keyboard, mouse, and controller players, The Crimson Contract delivers seamless squad-based action whether you're fighting alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.poster.avif?t=1784346366\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.webm?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/extras/9dc1b07d703dfd5252a0a2d71027bb79.mp4?t=1784346366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Enter the quarantine zone with your squad, build devastating loadouts, and survive endless infected hordes in this co-op zombie extraction shooter. Complete dangerous contracts, uncover the truth behind the outbreak, and fight your way out alive.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/faa60ffe5df9e386d093dfd95f9b979389767de9/header.jpg?t=1784346366", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631710/3